{
  "uid": "interpose-gateway-health",
  "title": "Interpose — Gateway Health",
  "tags": [
    "interpose"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Dashboard 1 of 4 (Section 12.4).** RED signals (Rate, Errors, Duration) for the gateway's hot path, plus saturation and per-upstream-server health.\n\n**Real, live Prometheus data**, not the earlier Postgres/audit-log approximation: the gateway emits five OTel metrics (`interpose_tool_calls_total`, `interpose_tool_call_errors_total`, `interpose_tool_call_duration_seconds`, `interpose_gateway_inflight`, `interpose_policy_fires_total` -- Section 12.3) through an in-cluster OTel Collector, which a real Prometheus scrapes. See `concepts/34-metrics-and-prometheus.md`. Rolling \"last 30 minutes\" window, not a fixed historical range -- this data is live, generated by whatever traffic the gateway actually sees, not a one-time synthetic corpus.\n\n**No data until real traffic happens.** A freshly-installed chart with nothing calling `/mcp/{server}` will show empty panels -- that's correct, not broken; drive a real MCP call through the gateway (or run `interpose demo aml --run`) to see it populate.\n\n**Not shown: circuit breaker states.** Section 12.4 names this as a Dashboard 1 panel, but no circuit breaker exists in the gateway today -- named gap, not faked here."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tool calls / sec (by outcome)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(interpose_tool_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency percentiles (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(interpose_tool_call_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(interpose_tool_call_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(interpose_tool_call_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(interpose_tool_call_errors_total[5m])) / sum(rate(interpose_tool_calls_total[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Saturation (in-flight tool calls)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(interpose_gateway_inflight)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Upstream MCP server health",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (server) (rate(interpose_tool_calls_total[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "calls/sec",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (server) (rate(interpose_tool_calls_total{outcome=\"upstream_error\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "errors/sec",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (server, le) (rate(interpose_tool_call_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "p95 latency (s)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "interpose-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
